experiment: silence
  instrument        silence   trial seed 000000000135b62e   4857 delivery, feedback balance and larynx threshold per tenth
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  INDEX SOURCE 4, inherited from the genome and NOT set by silence.
  The index reads the AUDITORY module, so a CtxDrive injected into the
  context module is IGNORED by it -- such an arm is DERIVED, not an
  oracle.
  An "oracle" arm is only an oracle when the drive and the index use the
  SAME module: ctx_match reads 1.000 for a genuine host-written index and
  well below it for a derived one.
  the finding       `dlvry`: delivery falls 0.716 -> 0.261 inside one
                    session, -0.4554 +- 0.0230 (19.8 SE), 12 of 12 down,
                    and EVERY missed trial is silent (0 degenerate,
                    residual 0). The creature stops answering.
  already refused   the reward is not the cause. praise/scold are
                    symmetric (+0.5/-0.5) and `boundprobe` shows the
                    praise share CONSTANT at 0.548 -> 0.536 at this
                    budget, so voicing stays net-positive while delivery
                    collapses. Carried here (`praise` column) so the
                    claim rests on THIS session, not another protocol.
  the hypothesis    IP is `threshold += ip_rate * (rate_ema - target)`, so
                    a larynx firing above target gets pushed up until the
                    voicing gate stops opening. That predicts an early,
                    steep, monotone decay that FLOORS where the threshold
                    stops moving -- which is the measured shape.
  the design        2 arms x 12 paired creatures, 13600000 ticks = 4857 trials.
                    `ipoff` sets homeo.ip_rate = 0 and changes nothing
                    else; same seeds, same wiring, same everything.
  the primary       last tenth minus first in the DELIVERED fraction, per
                    arm, and the arm difference. Pooled as a ratio of sums
                    and jackknifed over creatures, never meaned per
                    creature.
  THE DOSE CHECK    the `thr` column. `ipoff` must show a FLAT larynx
                    threshold and `ip` a rising one. If both move the knob
                    did not take and NO verdict below is available,
                    whatever the delivery columns say. A wired mechanism
                    is not a meaningful dose.
  stated up front   `ipoff` is known to COST learning (-7.42 SE), so the
                    arms differ in more than silence and this is not a
                    clean one-variable ablation. The question survives it:
                    does the decay SURVIVE with the homeostat off?
  the free control  the `ip` arm at this budget is `dirbudget`'s own call,
                    so its per-seed delivered total must reproduce that
                    ladder's column for the matching rung EXACTLY:

                      python3 tools/dlvry_predict.py \
                          results/dirbudget.log <this log>

