    the knob took: `ipoff` holds its threshold at 0% of the shipped
    arm's movement, so the arms really do differ in the homeostat.

  IP WAS HOLDING THE VOICE OPEN. With the homeostat off the decay is
  SMALLER by +0.4231 +- 0.0267 (15.8 SE) -- and `ipoff` keeps only 29% of
  the shipped decay. The homeostat is implicated in the quieting, and
  unlike the five earlier suspects it comes with a knob: `homeo.ip_rate`.
    WHAT THIS DOES NOT LICENSE: turning it down. `ipoff` costs learning
    (-7.42 SE), so the trade has to be priced before anything ships.
